  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Resize CPUs, RAM and disks of a running machine in one command by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1466\n* Let a stopped machine's egress policy be replaced by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1449\n* Give a machine that is still starting time before the ephemeral sweep reaps it by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1470\n* Bump the Nix package to 1.20.1 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1469\n* End a foreground packed run's VM with its CLI, and watch its mounts from the CLI by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1467\n* Bump the workspace to 1.20.2 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1468\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.20.1...v1.20.2",
